          "id": 1508516436,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "Hi Joao, I respectfully disagree. Please see image below.  You can see the DSCP value next to the name which doesn't exist for Voice Admit.\n\n![image](/uploads/673f867ede9a5d66fa85040d530364fd/image.png)",
