        {
          "id": 1508544759,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "No, those are not the DSCP values. \"Assured Forwarding 11\" is DSCP value 10, and \"Class Selector 4\" is DSCP value 32.\n\nhttps://www.iana.org/assignments/dscp-registry/dscp-registry.xhtml",
          "author": {
            "id": 6764551,
            "username": "johnthacker",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "John Thacker",
